            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a separator for an electrochemical device. The separator includes a separator substrate made of a porous polymer material, wherein the separator substrate has a small thickness, excellent resistance characteristics and ion conductivity, and high mechanical strength. When the separator is applied to a battery, it is possible to improve the output characteristics of the battery.</p>
            </abstract>
